  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Safety of Journalists in the Context of Election in the</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to create a safe space for journalists in covering the general election in the Philippines by encouraging press freedom and access to information in the era of disinformation. This goal will be achieved by providing capacity building for journalists in the Philippines regarding the general election that includes understanding the general election process and regulations that applied in the 2022 general election. Therefore, journalists will have a strong base of understanding, equipped with a groundwork of fact checks, and data-based journalism skills, as well as safety journalist background (physical and digital).</narrative>
  </description>
